{"akarmakaca": [{"id": "akarmakAcca", "headword": "अकर्मकाच्च", "headword_slp1": "akarmakAcca", "fold": "akarmakaca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "After the verb स्था 'to stand', preceded by उप , when meaning 'to adore', the आत्मनेपद affix is used.\n\nTerms: आत्मनेपद", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "After the verb कृ preceded by वि , when used intransitively, the आत्मनेपद is used.\n\nTerms: आत्मनेपद", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "And when used intransitively after the verb ज्ञ , the आत्मनेपद is used, when the fruit of the action does not accrue to the agent.\n\nTerms: आत्मनेपद", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अकर्मकाच्च १.३.२६", "अकर्मकाच्च १.३.३५", "अकर्मकाच्च १.३.४५", "१.३.२६", "१.३.२६ अकर्मकाच्च", "१.३.३५", "१.३.३५ अकर्मकाच्च", "१.३.४५", "१.३.४५ अकर्मकाच्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["akarmakAcca १.३.२६", "akarmakAcca १.३.३५", "akarmakAcca १.३.४५", "१.३.२६", "१.३.२६ akarmakAcca", "१.३.३५", "१.३.३५ akarmakAcca", "१.३.४५", "१.३.४५ akarmakAcca"]}], "akaTitan ca": [{"id": "akaTitaM ca", "headword": "अकथितं च", "headword_slp1": "akaTitaM ca", "fold": "akaTitan ca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "And if that कारक which is not spoken of as coming under any of the special relations of Ablation etc., is also called कर्म।\n\nTerms: कारक-कर्म", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अकथितं च १.४.५१", "१.४.५१", "१.४.५१ अकथितं च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["akaTitaM ca १.४.५१", "१.४.५१", "१.४.५१ akaTitaM ca"]}], "akartaryfRe paYcami": [{"id": "akartaryfRe paYcamI", "headword": "अकर्तर्यृणे पञ्चमी", "headword_slp1": "akartaryfRe paYcamI", "fold": "akartaryfRe paYcami", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "A word implying 'debt', considered as a 'cause' but not as कर्तृ or agent, takes the 5th case-affix.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-5", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अकर्तर्यृणे पञ्चमी २.३.२४", "२.३.२४", "२.३.२४ अकर्तर्यृणे 